{"uid":"90cb30bc941e4772","name":"test_allocate_revision_number_keeps_failing_closed_under_concurrent_sessions[postgresql]","fullName":"tests.test_workspace_revision_allocation_concurrency#test_allocate_revision_number_keeps_failing_closed_under_concurrent_sessions","historyId":"7f1d74b3c0608dea172f382cf6aef807","time":{"start":1792395117521,"stop":1792395117521,"duration":0},"description":"The bounded-retry failure path also fails closed with real contention.\n\n    ``test_workspace_revision_foundation.py::\n    test_allocator_reports_contention_after_bounded_compare_and_set_retries``\n    already proves this with a hand-written always-contended fake session;\n    this is the same guarantee against a real database and real concurrent\n    writers, at a low enough ``max_attempts`` that ``WORKER_COUNT`` genuine\n    contenders can exhaust it. Every allocation must either succeed with a\n    number in range or raise ``RevisionAllocationError`` -- never return a\n    wrong or duplicate number, and never leave the counter attempted-but-\n    unmoved.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The bounded-retry failure path also fails closed with real contention.</p>\n<pre><code>``test_workspace_revision_foundation.py::\ntest_allocator_reports_contention_after_bounded_compare_and_set_retries``\nalready proves this with a hand-written always-contended fake session;\nthis is the same guarantee against a real database and real concurrent\nwriters, at a low enough ``max_attempts`` that ``WORKER_COUNT`` genuine\ncontenders can exhaust it. Every allocation must either succeed with a\nnumber in range or raise ``RevisionAllocationError`` -- never return a\nwrong or duplicate number, and never leave the counter attempted-but-\nunmoved.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"skipped","statusMessage":"Skipped: CALIBER_TEST_POSTGRES_URL is not set (see the 'Migration parity (PostgreSQL)' CI job)","statusTrace":"('/home/runner/work/caliber-suite/caliber-suite/caliber/tests/test_workspace_revision_allocation_